when she's only a freshman.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.210
R...Right...

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.740
Uh... Hikaru...

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:03.990
I... I know it's not a very manly thing
for me to say this, but...

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:04.960
What is it?

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.660
Uh... well, I mean... what I mean is...
What is it?

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.290
Uh... well, I mean... what I mean is...

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:10.390
I'm kinda in a hurry now, so...
I'll see you later, okay?

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.590
Hikaru...

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.940
Say, wanna go with me to the bookstore
by the train station after school?

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.400
I found a great exam-prep book there.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.140
Oh... after school?
I've got a previous engagement...

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.540
A previous engagement, eh?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.950
But, I might be able to,
probably after 4:30 or so.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.510
By that time I'll be working at ABCB.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:33.350
Oh, Yuu! Are you doing all right?
With your exam prep and all?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.660
Oh, yes. Thank you.
Good luck to you too, Madoka.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:39.690
Well, then, I'll see you.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.330
Ayukawa! You know that kid?!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.300
Huh? Do you know him, Kasuga?

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.110
No...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.670
What?! Childhood friends?!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.640
Yeah. He, Hikaru and I, we all used to
play together when we were little.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.240
Aha... Hikaru too, huh?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.540
The three of us...
we used to take baths together too.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.340
You bathed together...?! Ow!

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:03.420
What are you so surprised about?
We were little! Oh, of course...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.610
Say, Kasuga... are you hiding something from me?

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:13.150
Why should I be hiding anything
from you, Ayukawa?

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.120
Ayukawa...

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.370
I'm home! Hey!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.240
I got a Chicken Basket for everybody.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:54.390
Yo, Jingoro! I also got you the Fried Fish that you like.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.300
Welcome home!

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.440
Oh! Is that from Mr. Fried Chicken?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.300
Yup. I just love their mannequin.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.540
Thank you for this feast!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:08.080
Say, Papa... is it okay to use
the Power on exams?

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.480
Of course not! I can't allow such cheating!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.960
Exams should be taken
without using special powers.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:13.850
That's been the rule in
the Kasuga Family for generations.

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.780
I see...

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.890
By the way, what happened to Kyosuke?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.990
He locked himself in his room and told us not to bother him, even for meals!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.060
R...Really? Kyosuke said that?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.310
He's making me proud of him, at last!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.700
He's realized that, as the heir to the Kasuga legacy...

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.700
He didn't say he was studying
for the exam, though.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:38.630
"Concentration..." Concentration!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:43.270
This isn't helping.
I'm not learning anything.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.880
"Just 'cause you've gotten to know her a little,
don't think you can get fresh!"

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.710
"Yeah. He, Hikaru and I, we all used to
play together when we were little."

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.350
"Good luck to you too, Madoka."

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:02.530
Childhood friends... Maybe he's seen
a side of Ayukawa that I haven't...

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.740
"Yippee! Yippee!"

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.570
"Oh, boy, am I pooped!"

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.370
"Why don't we take a bath?"
"Oh, boy, am I pooped!"

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:08.440
"Oh, boy, am I pooped!"

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.240
"Madoka, I'll wash your back for ya!"

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.000
"Sure, please..."
"Madoka, I'll wash your back for ya!"

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.090
He hasn't just seen "a" side,
he's seen all of them!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:20.660
Besides, Ayukawa might find out from him about me studying with Hikaru!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:23.880
And strength-wise, I can't compete...
What am I going to do?!

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:29.330
Because of this and that, I couldn't study at all!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.830
And now, it's the day before the exam!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:39.700
...we'll only be tested on stuff up to
Dazai Osamu's short story on pg. 28, right?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.270
What are the kanji for "Dazai?"

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:43.170
You're so lame!
What are the kanji for "Dazai?"

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:43.240
What are the kanji for "Dazai?"

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.000
What if you have to write the characters?!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.750
Look... it's the day before the exam!
Knock it off already!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.750
We're jealous of you, Kasuga!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.320
That's right!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.460
I mean, you've got to know your stuff
if you're privately tutoring Hikaru!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.820
You must really know your stuff!

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:59.690
I saw you... at the library yesterday!
You lucky bastard!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.260
Th...That... just happened...

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.950
I'll take that notebook!
Th...That... just happened...

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:03.030
Th...That... just happened...

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.730
Calm down. No harm done!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:05.920
Lemme go, you!
Calm down. No harm done!

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:09.770
Wow... it says, "Special Exam Prep Notes!"

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.270
Gimme that!

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:19.880
Ayukawa prepared this notebook just for me.

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:22.540
I can't possibly let a bunch
of guys like these see it!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.450
Ayukawa and... Yuusaku?!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.700
What's he... talking to her about...

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.890
...talking so friendly and all with Ayukawa?

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.880
C...Can't be...

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:56.840
Kasuga...
C...Can't be...

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:56.920
Huh...? Ayukawa!
Kasuga...

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.620
Huh...? Ayukawa!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:01.080
What're you gonna do, Kasuga?

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:02.890
What?

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:05.860
He says... he's really in love, after all.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:06.930
What?!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.960
So he was going after Ayukawa,
just like I thought!

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:12.200
He just told me... straight from the heart.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.230
He said, since we were little,
he was in love...

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:17.770
...with Hikaru.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.330
Huh?! With Hikaru?!
...with Hikaru.

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.980
Hmm... since he was little, eh?

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:26.200
Kasuga, what are you gonna do?
Hmm... since he was little, eh?

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:26.280
What do you mean what...?
Kasuga, what are you gonna do?

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:29.250
What do you mean what...?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:33.250
But, good thing Yuusaku wasn't
in love with you, Ayukawa, so...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:40.700
So it turned out that Ayukawa wasn't
the one Yuusaku was in love with...

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:45.920
Even better, she didn't find out about
what I was doing with Hikaru...

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.330
Whew... It's over at last!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.510
Say, Sempai...

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:53.110
...as a reward for all your tutoring,
will you let me buy you a coffee at ABCB?

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:54.430
Thanks... WHAT?!

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:57.080
Okay?!
I have to s...study for the exam tomorrow!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.840
It'll be fine! It'll be fine!
You can do that at ABCB!

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:03.800
If I go to ABCB with Hikaru, I'm in big trouble!
Damn! I've got no choice!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.220
This door won't open, Sempai!

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:17.430
It's strange... It's not even locked.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.500
Oh? In that case,
I guess we can't go to ABCB!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.770
Hey, what's up? What're you doing?

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:25.960
Sensei! Help! The door won't open!
Hey, what's up? What're you doing?

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:27.140
Geez...

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:27.600
It won't open?!
Geez...

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.070
Whoa!
It won't open?!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:30.140
Whoa!

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:33.210
Plan Number 2!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:42.950
That's odd... There's no sign of a train,
but the gates won't open.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:44.890
Maybe they're out of order?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.050
Oh, well...
Maybe they're out of order?

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:47.130
Maybe they're out of order?

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:49.630
...let's go through those other gates;
they're open!

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:51.850
Oh, right...

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.600
Oh, it's open now.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:55.900
Sorry for the inconvenience.
Oh, it's open now.

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.370
Say, Hikaru... you sure you wanna go there?

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.340
What do you mean am I sure?
We're here already.

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:08.280
Ah... You came here to study, eh?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.150
Yes, that's right, Madoka.
Ah... You came here to study, eh?

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:11.220
Ah... You came here to study, eh?

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:12.950
Uh-oh, here it comes...

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.710
Ah, Kasuga's helping you, eh?
Uh-oh, here it comes...

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:18.960
Yes. He's been helping me every day.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.890
What's gotten into you?!

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:23.090
Uh... Could I see the menu?
What's gotten into you?!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:23.160
Oh... Hold on a second.
Uh... Could I see the menu?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.060
Oh... Hold on a second.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.230
What's wrong with you, Sempai?

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.730
Oh, no, it's nothing...
What's wrong with you, Sempai?

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:29.150
That's my water.
Oh, no, it's nothing...

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.870
That's my water.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.040
Yikes! S...Sorry!

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.310
Here. Here you go.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.870
Oh, why, thank you.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:37.970
You're very welcome.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:43.420
Sempai? Did something you like go up in price?

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:46.420
It's okay even if it's a little expensive.
It's my treat, you know.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.560
Ayukawa...

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:52.700
In the end... that night...
I was so exhausted from...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.000
...too much worrying and Power-using
that I couldn't study at all.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.300
No... maybe it's because
I was feeling relieved...

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:01.330
...because I found something
really nice in the menu.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:05.040
"I'll bet that you wouldn't like it,
being a guy...

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.510
"...if she finds out that
I've been tutoring you...

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:10.180
"...so I won't tell Hikaru about it."

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:13.080
"To wrap up things...
I've compiled this notebook...

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:16.320
"...containing what I think will be
the key questions on the exam."

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:19.420
"My hunch is usually right about such things,
so best of luck to you."

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:22.450
-- "Madoka-sensei"

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.760
Was that a bit too sweet of me?

00:22:33.230 --> 00:22:38.100
Since when did you get so sweet, Madoka?

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:44.840
Truly, Madoka's hunch was so dead-on...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:44.940
"Ayukawa Madoka"
Truly, Madoka's hunch was so dead-on...

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:45.010
"Ayukawa Madoka"

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:47.350
...that she ended up third overall!
"Ayukawa Madoka"

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:47.410
"Ayukawa Madoka"

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:49.280
However... as for me,
I ended up third from the bottom...

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:51.720
"#255: Kasuga Kyosuke"
"#256: Hatta. #257: Komatsu"

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:52.950
Yo, bud!

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:53.540
Buddies!
Yo, bud!

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:54.380
Chum!
Buddies!

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:54.450
Chum!

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:57.610
Perhaps my concentration wasn't
what it should have been.

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:01.890
Really, how am I supposed to face Ayukawa?

00:23:01.890 --> 00:23:04.960
So, what is it? What was it that
you want to talk to me about?

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.040
Uh... well...

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:09.970
...what I wanted to tell you was that...

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:12.540
What is it? Just say it.

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:17.640
That kid... he's gonna tell her
about Ayukawa and me!

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.780
N... It's nothing at all!

00:23:19.780 --> 00:23:22.970
Ooh, yeow!

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.410
I can't believe him!

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:30.090
Oh well, anyway,
Hikaru didn't find out about us...

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.500
...and Ayukawa treated me kindly to boot!

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:35.660
I feel sorry for Yuusaku, but... I got a happy ending!

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:39.860
Care to explain to me the grade you got, Kasuga?!

00:23:39.860 --> 00:23:43.920
So much for the happy ending!

00:23:54.980 --> 00:24:02.590
I dream of casting a spell that
captures your heart...

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:10.170
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:25.520
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:38.130
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.130 --> 00:24:48.340
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:55.350
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.350 --> 00:25:06.750
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:14.030 --> 00:25:16.800
I saw Ayukawa yesterday,
and went to a semi-decent shop...

00:25:16.800 --> 00:25:19.940
...I remember that much, but...

00:25:19.940 --> 00:25:23.880
...I can't exactly remember what I did after that.

00:25:23.880 --> 00:25:27.040
Oh! I forced Ayukawa to kiss me?!

00:25:27.040 --> 00:25:31.170
Next time: "Madoka's Private Life?!
A Spark-Colored Kiss."
